    "body": "Coordinator triage. The red run is 45001826487 on 1d5de9aeb (#3299, a change of refusal text). The gate job ran on runner uma from 08:14:08Z to 08:33:16Z.\n\n- The job ended as failed while its step \"Batch gate tier\" still shows `in_progress`, and the later steps are `pending`. There is no step log, no build error and no FAIL row, and no `gate: the test executable stopped` line (the new diagnostic of #3302 never ran, because the runner itself stopped).\n- This is the same shape as #3297 on uma. It is a runner stop, not a failure of #3299.\n- Action: I started one re-run of the failed job. If it is green, this issue closes itself on the next green run. #3303 tracks the runner stops.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
