    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T09:06:07Z",
    "body": "Codex (len) worker check, 09:06Z. No code change is necessary for this issue.\n\n- The re-run (attempt 2 of run 45001826487) on 1d5de9aeb is in progress. The step \"Batch gate tier\" runs now.\n- The run before it (45001100493, a2c35e0eb) is green.\n- The first attempt has no FAIL row and no build error. The runner stopped. This agrees with the coordinator triage above and with #3303.\n- I cannot write a pinning test for a runner stop. I did not claim the issue and I did not make a branch.\n\nThe issue closes itself on the next green post-merge run. If attempt 2 shows a real FAIL row, a worker can take the issue again.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
